 "defect_observations": [
  "annex 204-206 (annex:p15.submartingale-ui) derives F_infinity-measurability of the limit from measurability of the X_n; this needs adaptedness, which the governing def:p15-filtration-martingale (handbook/parts/p15/martingales-and-convergence.tex 15-26) is recorded by packet duty 162.1/C001 as not requiring. Correctness/dependency issue in another unit's definition; not a coverage gap here.",
  "body 188 states |Y|<=Z almost surely in thm:p15-changing-conditional-limits; the annex (307-349) uses it (dominated convergence at 318-319) without writing the one-line limit step.",
  "body 110-121 thm:p15-submartingale-ui carries no inline locator for Durrett Theorem 4.6.4 (p. 246); only the chapter-level pp. 244-250 citation covers it. Its added terminal inequality X_n<=E(X_infinity|F_n) is not in source Theorem 4.6.4 and is proved in the annex."
 ],
